# This folder doubles as a standalone repo for publishing the Mega Energy color lab. Only the
# finished, self-contained tool and the source data it was built from are tracked; everything
# else here (build scripts, research experiments, generated renders) is local-only tooling that
# lives in the private PoGoRankIV checkout and isn't needed to use mega_lab.html.
#
# `/*` anchors to top-level entries only, so `!/raw/` un-ignores the whole raw/ subtree (nothing
# inside it is re-ignored) without needing a `raw/**` exception too.
/*
!/raw/
!/mega_lab.html
!/research_notes/
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
